# MODAL-06 — Inert/aria-hidden the rest of the page

## Rationale

Background content should be `inert` (or `aria-hidden`) so AT users can't tab into it behind the modal.

## How to check

Verify background is made inert when the modal opens.

## How to fix

Propose toggling `inert` on the main content wrapper.
